# 詞: 睇怕

1. 佢成日吹水講自己幾叻，但一遇到真嘢就即刻睇怕。 (He always boasts about how smart he is, but he gets scared stiff as soon as he faces a real challenge.)
2. 你唔好睇怕，呢個考試其實好簡單㗎。 (Don't be intimidated; this exam is actually very easy.)
3. 見到佢咁高大，好多人都會唔自覺地睇怕佢。 (Seeing how tall and big he is, many people unconsciously feel intimidated by him.)
4. 雖然對手好強，但我哋唔可以未打就睇怕。 (Although the opponent is very strong, we shouldn't lose our nerve before the game even starts.)
5. 佢性格好軟弱，一被人鬧就即刻睇怕，唔敢出聲。 (He has a weak personality; as soon as someone scolds him, he gets scared and doesn't dare to speak up.)
6. 做生意要有膽色，唔可以一見到風險就睇怕。 (To do business, you need courage; you can't get scared stiff just because you see some risks.)
7. 佢以為自己好犀利，點知遇到真正嘅高手，即刻睇怕晒。 (He thought he was very impressive, but when he met a real master, he was completely intimidated.)
8. 你唔使睇怕佢，佢其實只係虛張聲勢啫。 (You don't need to be afraid of him; he's actually just bluffing.)
9. 第一次上台演講，我緊張到睇怕，連講咩都唔記得。 (For my first time giving a speech on stage, I was so nervous and intimidated that I forgot what to say.)
10. 呢個項目難度好高，好多同事都睇怕，唔敢接手。 (This project is very difficult; many colleagues are intimidated and don't dare to take it on.)

完成10句例句 [end of text]


